@* [고인 등록 · 수정] — 인적 사항과 상주·계약자·담당자를 한 번에 저장한다(funeral/building/deceased/{id}/detail). 서버가 그 묶음을 통째로 받는다.
호실은 여기서 정하지 않는다. 등록 때만 첫 호실을 고르고 이동은 목록의 호실 이동이 맡는다. 상세 저장으로 옮기면 그 사이 다른 사람의 값을 덮는다. 주민번호는 상세에서만 오므로 목록에는 흘리지 않는다. *@

@inherits DataPage

<CommPopup Visible="@Visible" VisibleChanged="@OnVisibleChanged"
         HeaderText="@(IsNew ? "고인 등록" : "고인 수정")" Width="880px" ShowFooter="false">
    <BodyContentTemplate Context="popup">

        @if (_form is null)
        {
            <p class="fn-note">읽는 중입니다 …</p>
        }
        else
        {
            <section class="fn-devsec is-on">
                <h3 class="fn-devsec__head">인적 사항</h3>
                <div class="fn-devsec__body">
                    <DeviceField Label="고인명">
                        <DxTextBox @bind-Text="_form.Name" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="성별">
                        <DxComboBox Data="@Genders" TextFieldName="Name" ValueFieldName="Code"
                                    @bind-Value="_form.Gender" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="나이">
                        <DxSpinEdit @bind-Value="_form.Age" MinValue="0" MaxValue="150" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="종교">
                        <DxTextBox @bind-Text="_form.Religion" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="주민번호">
                        <DxTextBox @bind-Text="_form.Ssn" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="사인">
                        <DxTextBox @bind-Text="_form.CauseOfDeath" />
                    </DeviceField>

                    <DeviceField Label="임종">
                        <DxDateEdit @bind-Date="_form.DeathDate" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="발인">
                        <DxDateEdit @bind-Date="_form.FuneralDate" TimeSectionVisible="true" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="장지 일시">
                        <DxDateEdit @bind-Date="_form.BurialDate" TimeSectionVisible="true" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="장지">
                        <DxTextBox @bind-Text="_form.BurialPlot" />
                    </DeviceField>

                    @if (IsNew)
                    {
                        <DeviceField Label="첫 호실">
                            <DxComboBox Data="@Rooms" TextFieldName="@nameof(Room.Name)"
                                        ValueFieldName="@nameof(Room.Id)"
                                        @bind-Value="_form.RoomId"
                                        ClearButtonDisplayMode="DataEditorClearButtonDisplayMode.Auto" />
                        </DeviceField>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <DeviceField Label="호실">
                            <span class="fn-note">@(_form.RoomName ?? "배정 없음") — 목록의 「호실 이동」에서 바꿉니다.</span>
                        </DeviceField>
                    }

                    <DeviceField Label="비고" Wide="true">
                        <DxTextBox @bind-Text="_form.Remark" />
                    </DeviceField>
                </div>
            </section>

            @* 영정사진은 한 장이라 빈소 화면이 그 자리에 띄우고, 추모 앨범은 여러 장이 도는 파일 그룹이라 부품이 다르다. *@
            <section class="fn-devsec is-on">
                <h3 class="fn-devsec__head">
                    사진
                    <span class="fn-note">영정사진은 3:4 세로가 잘 맞습니다.</span>
                </h3>

                <div class="fn-devsec__body">
                    <DeviceField Label="영정사진">
                        <div class="fn-portrait">
                            @if (PortraitUrl is { Length: > 0 } portrait)
                            {
                                <img class="fn-portrait__img" src="@portrait" alt="영정사진" />
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                <span class="fn-portrait__none">미등록</span>
                            }

                            <div class="fn-portrait__tools">
                                <label class="fn-portrait__pick">
                                    <InputFile OnChange="@UploadPortraitAsync" accept="image/*" disabled="@_uploading" />
                                    <span>@(_uploading ? "올리는 중…" : "사진 고르기")</span>
                                </label>

                                @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_form.MemorialPhotoFileId)
                                     || !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_form.MemorialPhotoUrl))
                                {
                                    @* 지우는 것은 연결을 끊는 것이다. 파일은 FileServer 에 남는다(옛 주소를 든 화면이 있을 수 있다). *@
                                    <DxButton Text="빼기" RenderStyle="ButtonRenderStyle.Secondary"
                                              Enabled="@(!_uploading)" Click="@ClearPortrait" />
                                }
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </DeviceField>

                    <DeviceField Label="추모 앨범" Wide="true">
                        @* 입구 모니터와 분향소 화면이 순서대로 돌린다. *@
                        <ImageGroup @bind-GroupId="_form.FamilyPhotoGroupId"
                                    BizType="DECEASED" Limit="20" />
                    </DeviceField>
                </div>
            </section>

            @* 시설 사용: 안치실·염습실처럼 빈소와 따로 쓰는 자리. 이 값이 정산으로 그대로 가고, 시간과 단가를 넣으면 금액이 나온다. *@
            <section class="fn-devsec is-on">
                <h3 class="fn-devsec__head">
                    시설 사용
                    <span class="fn-note">정산의 항목이 됩니다.</span>
                </h3>

                <div class="jsini-toolbar">
                    <DxButton Text="시설 추가"
                              RenderStyle="ButtonRenderStyle.Secondary" Click="@AddFacility" />
                </div>

                @if (_form.Facilities.Count == 0)
                {
                    <p class="fn-note">등록된 시설 사용이 없습니다.</p>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="fn-devsec__body">
                        @foreach (var facility in _form.Facilities)
                        {
                            <DeviceField Label="시설">
                                <DxComboBox Data="@_roomTypes" Value="@facility.FacilityType"
                                            ValueChanged="@((string v) => facility.FacilityType = v)"
                                            ValueExpression="@(() => facility.FacilityType)"
                                            TextFieldName="@nameof(CommonCode.CodeName)"
                                            ValueFieldName="@nameof(CommonCode.CodeValue)" />
                            </DeviceField>

                            <DeviceField Label="시작">
                                <DxDateEdit Date="@facility.StartTime"
                                            DateChanged="@((DateTime? v) => SetFacilityTime(facility, v, null))"
                                            DateExpression="@(() => facility.StartTime)"
                                            TimeSectionVisible="true" />
                            </DeviceField>

                            <DeviceField Label="종료">
                                <DxDateEdit Date="@facility.EndTime"
                                            DateChanged="@((DateTime? v) => SetFacilityTime(facility, null, v))"
                                            DateExpression="@(() => facility.EndTime)"
                                            TimeSectionVisible="true" />
                            </DeviceField>

                            <DeviceField Label="사용 시간">
                                @* 시작·종료를 넣으면 채워진다. 손으로도 고칠 수 있다. 실제로 쓴 시간이 시계와 다를 때가 있다. *@
                                <DxSpinEdit Value="@facility.UseHours"
                                            ValueChanged="@((double v) => SetFacilityHours(facility, v))"
                                            ValueExpression="@(() => facility.UseHours)"
                                            MinValue="0" />
                            </DeviceField>

                            <DeviceField Label="단가">
                                <DxSpinEdit Value="@facility.UnitPrice"
                                            ValueChanged="@((decimal v) => SetFacilityPrice(facility, v))"
                                            ValueExpression="@(() => facility.UnitPrice)"
                                            MinValue="0" />
                            </DeviceField>

                            <DeviceField Label="금액">
                                @* 사용 시간 × 단가. 서버가 다시 세지 않으므로 여기서 맞춘다. *@
                                <span class="fn-note">@facility.TotalPrice.ToString("N0") 원</span>
                            </DeviceField>

                            <DeviceField Label="비고" Wide="true">
                                <div class="jsini-inline">
                                    <DxTextBox Text="@facility.Remark"
                                               TextChanged="@((string v) => facility.Remark = v)" />
                                    <DxButton Text="빼기" RenderStyle="ButtonRenderStyle.Secondary"
                                              Click="@(() => _form.Facilities.Remove(facility))" />
                                </div>
                            </DeviceField>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
            </section>

            <section class="fn-devsec is-on">
                <h3 class="fn-devsec__head">
                    상주
                    <span class="fn-note">대표 상주는 한 명입니다. 새로 고르면 앞의 것이 풀립니다.</span>
                </h3>

                <div class="jsini-toolbar">
                    <DxButton Text="상주 추가"
                              RenderStyle="ButtonRenderStyle.Secondary" Click="@AddMourner" />
                </div>

                @if (_form.Mourners.Count == 0)
                {
                    <p class="fn-note">등록된 상주가 없습니다.</p>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="fn-devsec__body">
                        @foreach (var mourner in _form.Mourners)
                        {
                            <DeviceField Label="이름">
                                <DxTextBox Text="@mourner.Name"
                                           TextChanged="@((string v) => mourner.Name = v)" />
                            </DeviceField>
                            <DeviceField Label="관계">
                                <DxTextBox Text="@mourner.Relation"
                                           TextChanged="@((string v) => mourner.Relation = v)" />
                            </DeviceField>
                            <DeviceField Label="연락처">
                                <DxTextBox Text="@mourner.Contact"
                                           TextChanged="@((string v) => mourner.Contact = v)" />
                            </DeviceField>
                            <DeviceField Label="대표 · 빼기">
                                <div class="jsini-inline">
                                    <DxCheckBox Checked="@mourner.IsChief"
                                                CheckedChanged="@((bool v) => SetChief(mourner, v))">대표</DxCheckBox>
                                    <DxButton Text="빼기"
                                              RenderStyle="ButtonRenderStyle.Secondary"
                                              Click="@(() => _form.Mourners.Remove(mourner))" />
                                </div>
                            </DeviceField>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
            </section>

            <section class="fn-devsec is-on">
                <h3 class="fn-devsec__head">계약자</h3>
                <div class="fn-devsec__body">
                    <DeviceField Label="이름">
                        <DxTextBox Text="@Contractor.Name"
                                   TextChanged="@((string v) => Contractor.Name = v)" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="연락처">
                        <DxTextBox Text="@Contractor.Contact"
                                   TextChanged="@((string v) => Contractor.Contact = v)" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="관계">
                        <DxTextBox Text="@Contractor.Relation"
                                   TextChanged="@((string v) => Contractor.Relation = v)" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="주소" Wide="true">
                        <DxTextBox Text="@Contractor.Address"
                                   TextChanged="@((string v) => Contractor.Address = v)" />
                    </DeviceField>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="fn-devsec is-on">
                <h3 class="fn-devsec__head">담당</h3>
                <div class="fn-devsec__body">
                    <DeviceField Label="지도사">
                        <DxTextBox Text="@Manager.DirectorName"
                                   TextChanged="@((string v) => Manager.DirectorName = v)" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="지도사 연락처">
                        <DxTextBox Text="@Manager.DirectorContact"
                                   TextChanged="@((string v) => Manager.DirectorContact = v)" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="상조회사">
                        <DxTextBox Text="@Manager.MutualAidCompany"
                                   TextChanged="@((string v) => Manager.MutualAidCompany = v)" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="상조 담당자">
                        <DxTextBox Text="@Manager.StaffName"
                                   TextChanged="@((string v) => Manager.StaffName = v)" />
                    </DeviceField>
                    <DeviceField Label="상조 연락처">
                        <DxTextBox Text="@Manager.StaffContact"
                                   TextChanged="@((string v) => Manager.StaffContact = v)" />
                    </DeviceField>
                </div>
            </section>

            <div class="jsini-toolbar">
                <DxButton Text="저장" RenderStyle="ButtonRenderStyle.Primary" Click="@SaveAsync" />
                <DxButton Text="닫기" RenderStyle="ButtonRenderStyle.Secondary"
                          Click="@(() => OnVisibleChanged(false))" />
            </div>
        }
    </BodyContentTemplate>
</CommPopup>
